#: src/ui/settings.rs:602
msgid ""
"Choose devices for recordings, playback and calls. A saved camera is used "
"the next time you turn it on."
msgstr ""

#: src/ui/settings.rs:605 src/ui/settings.rs:2503
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:607
msgid "Desktop notifications"
msgstr "桌面通知"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:610
msgid "For chats you are not looking at. Muted chats stay quiet."
msgstr "用於您未正在查看的對話。已靜音的對話不會發出通知。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:616
msgid "In-app notification cards"
msgstr "應用程式內通知卡片"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:618
msgid ""
"Show notifications in the desktop corner, even while the window is hidden, "
"with the same privacy and mute settings."
msgstr "即使視窗已隱藏，也在螢幕角落顯示通知，並遵循相同的隱私和靜音設定。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:620
msgid ""
"Show notifications inside the window, with the same privacy and mute "
"settings."
msgstr "在視窗內顯示通知，使用相同的隱私和靜音設定。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:625
msgid "Show notification sender"
msgstr "顯示通知傳送者"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:628
msgid "Show chat names and pictures in desktop notifications."
msgstr "在桌面通知中顯示聊天名稱和頭像。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:633
msgid "Show notification content"
msgstr "顯示通知內容"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:636
msgid "Include message previews. Hidden senders also hide content."
msgstr "包含訊息預覽。隱藏傳送者時也會隱藏內容。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:643
msgid "Limit repeat notifications"
msgstr "限制重複通知"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:646
msgid ""
"After one notification, a chat stays quiet for 10 minutes. Opening the chat "
"resets this. In groups, mentions and replies to you still notify."
msgstr ""
"通知一次後，該對話會保持安靜 10 分鐘。開啟該對話會重新計時。在群組中，提及您"
"和回覆您的訊息仍會通知。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:672 src/ui/settings.rs:2510
msgid "Play sounds for group messages"
msgstr "群組訊息播放提示音"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:675
msgid "When off, only mentions and replies to you make a sound."
msgstr "關閉後，只有提及您或回覆您的訊息才會發出聲音。"

