msgid ""
"Could not load your account privacy. Trying again when ZapFastest reconnects."
msgstr "無法載入您的帳號隱私設定，將在 ZapFastest 重新連線後再試一次。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:714
msgid "Connect to WhatsApp to change your account privacy."
msgstr "請連線至 WhatsApp 以變更您的帳號隱私設定。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:719
msgid "Loading your account privacy…"
msgstr "正在載入您的帳號隱私設定…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:744
msgid "Change who is excluded on your phone."
msgstr "請在手機上變更被排除的人員。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:764 src/ui/settings.rs:1215
msgid "Screen privacy"
msgstr "螢幕隱私"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:767 src/ui/settings.rs:1546
msgid "System"
msgstr "系統"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:769
msgid "Unread count on tray icon"
msgstr "系統匣圖示顯示未讀數量"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:770
msgid ""
"Show the total unread chat count across accounts, up to 99+. Hidden while "
"the app is locked or screen privacy is on."
msgstr ""
"顯示所有帳號的未讀聊天總數，上限為 99+。應用程式鎖定或開啟螢幕隱私時隱藏。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:774
msgid "VIP tray indicator"
msgstr "系統匣 VIP 標記"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:775
msgid ""
"Highlight unread VIP chats. Mark a chat as VIP from its menu. Muted, "
"archived and locked chats are excluded."
msgstr ""
"凸顯未讀 VIP 聊天。可在聊天選單中將其標記為 VIP。已靜音、已封存和已鎖定的聊天"
"不計入。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:779
msgid "Keep running when the window closes"
msgstr "關閉視窗後繼續在背景執行"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:780
msgid "Quit from the tray or with Ctrl+Q."
msgstr "請從系統匣選單退出，或按 Ctrl+Q。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:784
msgid "Ctrl+W closes the chat"
msgstr "Ctrl+W 關閉聊天"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:785
msgid ""
"Close the open chat with Ctrl+W instead of closing the window. Turn off to "
"keep the window shortcut."
msgstr "使用 Ctrl+W 關閉目前聊天而非視窗。關閉此設定可保留關閉視窗的快捷鍵。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:790 src/ui/settings.rs:798
msgid "Start at login"
msgstr "登入時啟動"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:791
msgid "Starts in the tray, without a window."
msgstr "啟動時會在系統匣中執行，不顯示視窗。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:814
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "檢查更新"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:817
msgid "Asks GitHub once a day, sending only the ZapFastest version."
msgstr "每天向 GitHub 詢問一次，只傳送 ZapFastest 的版本資訊。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:822
msgid "Download updates automatically"
msgstr "自動下載更新"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:825
msgid ""
"You still choose when to restart. Package managers and Flatpak update "
"ZapFastest themselves."
msgstr ""
"您仍可自行選擇重新啟動的時間。套件管理員與 Flatpak 會自行更新 ZapFastest。"

