"Remove only old, unreferenced media-cache files. Archived attachments and "
"background recovery files stay saved. Removed files may not be recoverable."
msgstr ""
"僅移除不再被參照的舊媒體快取檔案。已封存的附件與背景復原檔案會保留。移除的檔"
